"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F104036078858972_1137124488879549+-+HURRICANE+UPDATE+%2F+OUTAGES+EMC+REPORTS%3Aroughly+52%2C300+meters+out+in+the+storm%2C+but+have+restored+32%2C500.++We+are+prioritizing+getting+circuits+back+online%2C+which+we+currently+have+14+out.++That+will+restore+a+large+portion+of+the+outages.++400++linemen+and+right+of+way+personnel+being+mobilized+today+at+our+basecamp.++FAIRHOPE+REPORTS+400+meters+out%2C+but+most+back+on.++RIVIERA+REPORTS+Meters+restored+since+9am+Friday+approximately+21%2C0005%2C000+meters+restored+since+midnight+Less+than+5%2C000+left+to+restore.+We+have+an+additional+100+contractors+working+right+now.++As+we+recover+from+the+hurricane%2C+I+want+our+District+94+neighbors+and+families+across+Baldwin+County+to+have+reliable+information+about+power+outages+and+emergency+updates.+The+apps+are+a+good+way+to+keep+updated.++%F0%9F%94%8C+Baldwin+EMCDownload+the+Baldwin+EMC+app%3A+iPhoneAndroidCheck+the+outage+map+or+report+an+outage+at+251-989-6247.To+enroll+in+outage+texting%2C+text+BALDWIN+to+85700+from+the+phone+number+on+your+account%2C+then+text+OUTAGE+to+report+an+outage.+%28apps.apple.com%2C+play.google.com%2C+baldwinemc.com%29%F0%9F%94%8C+Riviera+UtilitiesDownload+the+Riviera+Utilities+app+to+report+outages+and+receive+updates%3A+iPhone+%7C+Android.+Check+the+outage+map+and+status.Report+outages%3A+Foley%3A+251-943-4999+%7C+Daphne%3A+251-625-4999.+%28apps.apple.com%2C+play.google.com%2C+rivierautilities.com%29%F0%9F%94%8C+Fairhope+UtilitiesReport+outages+at+251-928-8003%2C+available+24+hours+a+day.Follow+Fairhope%E2%80%99s+outage+and+road+closure+updates.+%28fairhopeal.gov%2C+fairhopeal.gov%29%F0%9F%94%8C+Robertsdale+UtilitiesReport+outages+at+251-947-8950%2C+Monday%E2%80%93Friday%2C+7+a.m.%E2%80%934+p.m.%2C+or+251-947-2222+after+hours.+%28robertsdale.org%29%F0%9F%94%8C+Alabama+PowerCheck+the+outage+map+and+storm+center+or+report+an+outage+at+1-800-888-2726.+%28alabamapower.com%29%F0%9F%93%B2+Baldwin+County+EMAFor+county+information+and+emergency+notifications%2C+download+the+Baldwin+County+AL+Commission+app%3A+iPhone+%7C+Android.Sign+up+for+Alert+Baldwin+to+receive+emergency+alerts+by+text%2C+phone%2C+or+email.+%28apps.apple.com%2C+play.google.com%2C+baldwincountyal.gov%29For+official+storm+and+recovery+announcements%2C+visit+Baldwin+County+EMA%E2%80%99s+storm+updates+and+baldwincountyal.gov.+%28baldwincountyal.gov%29Please+report+outages+directly+to+the+provider+listed+on+your+electric+bill%2C+stay+away+from+downed+power+lines%2C+and+call+911+for+immediate+danger.+%28baldwinemc.com%2C+alabamapower.com%29Thank+you+to+our+utility+crews%2C+first+responders%2C+and+everyone+helping+their+neighbors.+Please+check+on+those+around+you%2C+especially+anyone+who+may+need+extra+assistance%E2%80%94we+have+always+been+a+community+that+takes+care+of+one+another.I+feel+like+God+sent+a+hug+yesterday+as+we+dodged+this+bullet%2C+so+I%E2%80%99m+thankful.++It%E2%80%99s+time+to+help+neighbors+as+they+need.++Stay+safe+in+your+clean+up.++God+bless%2C+%E2%80%94+Representative+Jennifer+FidlerAlabama+House+District+94"
},
